{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24559","headline":"雪朝乘兴欲诣李司徒留守先以五韵戏之 · 白居易","name":"雪朝乘兴欲诣李司徒留守先以五韵戏之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"夜寒生酒思，晓雪引诗情。\n热饮一两醆，冷吟三五声。\n铺花怜地冻，销玉畏天晴。\n好拂乌巾出，宜披鹤氅行。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24559.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24559","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}